dialogs
0	I challenged the GYM LEADER, but…It's not going to be easy winning with my FIRE-type POKéMON…FIRE-type POKéMON don't match up well against ROCK-type POKéMON…
1	The DEVON CORPORATION… We all just shorten it to DEVON.That company makes all sorts of convenient products.
2	POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL!If I go to this school, will I be able to catch rare POKéMON easily?
3	Wow, you have POKéMON with you, too.When I get bigger, I'm going to go places with POKéMON, too.
4	The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in a cottage by the sea.He goes for walks in the tunnel every so often.
5	Have you taken the POKéMON GYM challenge?When you get that shiny GYM BADGE in hand, I guess TRAINERS begin to realize what is required of them.
6	If a POKéMON gains experience in battles, it can sometimes change in the way it looks.
7	A POKéMON changes shape? If one did that, I would be shocked!
8	That shady character, I think he took off towards the tunnel over there.
10	Oh? Who might you be? You're a new face around these parts.Have you just transferred into the POKéMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL?
12	A POKéMON you get in a trade from someone grows fast.But if you don't have certain GYM BADGES, it may not obey you…
15	Did you know this?You can have a 2-on-2 battle even if you're not with another TRAINER.If you catch the eyes of two TRAINERS when you have two or more POKéMON, they'll both challenge you.Don't you think it'd be cool if you could beat two TRAINERS by yourself?
